---
const title = "AI Improved — Your business. Improved with AI.";
const description = "We uncover costly inefficiencies, redesign outdated processes and implement practical improvements that help established businesses operate more effectively.";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://aiimproved.io/" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://aiimproved.io/" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <style is:global>
      :root {
        --bg: #FAFBFC;
        --text: #0F172A;
        --text-secondary: #475569;
        --accent: #0F766E;
        --accent-hover: #115E59;
        --border: #E2E8F0;
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      header, main, footer { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem; }
      header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
      .logo { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; }
      nav a { margin-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; }
      nav a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
      .hero { padding: 4rem 0 2rem; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2.75rem; line-height: 1.1; margin: 0 0 1rem; font-weight: 600; }
      .hero p { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 42rem; }
      .cta {
        display: inline-block;
        background: var(--accent);
        color: white;
        padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 500;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
      }
      .cta:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); }
      section { padding: 3rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
      h2 { font-size: 1.75rem; margin-top: 0; }
      .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
      .card { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem; }
      footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.875rem; }
      .enquiry-disabled {
        max-width: 32rem;
        background: white;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }
      .enquiry-disabled p { margin-top: 0; }
      .enquiry-disabled fieldset { border: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
      .enquiry-disabled label { display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); }
      .enquiry-disabled input, .enquiry-disabled textarea {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 0.5rem;
        margin-top: 0.25rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 4px;
        background: #f1f5f9;
      }
      .enquiry-disabled button { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }
      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
        header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
        nav a { margin-left: 0; margin-right: 1rem; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <a href="/" class="logo">AI Improved</a>
      <nav>
        <a href="#how-we-work">How We Work</a>
        <a href="#what-we-improve">What We Improve</a>
        <a href="/assessment">Assessment</a>
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <h1>Your business. Improved with AI.</h1>
        <p>We uncover costly inefficiencies, redesign outdated processes and implement practical improvements that help established businesses operate more effectively.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="cta">Discuss a business improvement</a>
      </section>

      <section id="how-we-work">
        <h2>How We Work</h2>
        <p>Find the business problem first. Use AI where it genuinely helps.</p>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card"><strong>1. Discover</strong><p>Understand goals, current processes, and constraints.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><strong>2. Assess</strong><p>Identify bottlenecks, wasted effort, and the value of improvement.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><strong>3. Design</strong><p>Prioritize realistic opportunities and redesign workflows.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><strong>4. Implement</strong><p>Build only what is approved. Test and document.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><strong>5. Measure</strong><p>Compare performance against the original baseline.</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="what-we-improve">
        <h2>What We Improve</h2>
        <p>Examples of operational areas we examine. These are not fixed-price packages.</p>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card"><h3>Operational efficiency</h3><p>Bottlenecks, handoffs, and wasted effort in core workflows.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Sales and customer workflows</h3><p>Quoting, scheduling, follow-up, and CRM processes.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Administration and documents</h3><p>Onboarding, document handling, and internal coordination.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Reporting and decisions</h3><p>Visibility into performance and clearer decision support.</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="assessment">
        <h2>Business Assessment</h2>
        <p>An assessment comes before implementation. We examine clearly defined processes, establish problems and opportunities, and produce a practical assessment with an estimated business case.</p>
        <p><a href="/assessment">Learn more about the assessment</a></p>
      </section>

      <section id="contact">
        <h2>Discuss a business improvement</h2>
        <div class="enquiry-disabled">
          <p><strong>The website is not currently accepting enquiries.</strong></p>
          <fieldset disabled>
            <label>Name<br><input type="text" name="name" disabled /></label>
            <label>Business name<br><input type="text" name="business" disabled /></label>
            <label>Work email<br><input type="email" name="email" disabled /></label>
            <label>Website<br><input type="url" name="website" disabled /></label>
            <label>Business problem or process to improve<br><textarea name="problem" rows="4" disabled></textarea></label>
            <button type="button" class="cta" disabled>Submit enquiry</button>
          </fieldset>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <p>AI Improved is operated by LinkDaddy LLC.</p>
      <p><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a> · <a href="/about">About</a></p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
